    {
      "id": "day1-p6",
      "part": 6,
      "title": "Part 6 | Text Completion 短文填空",
      "minutes": 7,
      "passages": [
        {
          "title": "Staff Notice",
          "text": "NOTICE TO ALL STAFF\nBeginning next Monday, the west entrance of the Dalton Research Center will be closed [13] repairs. Employees should use the east entrance [14] further notice. Visitors must sign in at the reception desk, where they will receive temporary badges. Because parking spaces near the east entrance are limited, staff members are [15] to use public transportation whenever possible. The work is expected to take approximately two weeks. [16] The center apologizes for any inconvenience this may [17].",
          "zh": "全体员工通知\n从下周一起，Dalton 研究中心的西门将 [13] 由于 维修而关闭。员工请改走东门，[14] 直到 另行通知为止。访客必须在前台登记，并在那里领取临时胸牌。由于东门附近停车位有限，员工 [15] 被鼓励 尽量使用公共交通。施工预计大约需要两周。[16] 入口重新开放时会另行发通知。 本中心对此可能 [17] 造成 的任何不便深表歉意。"
        }
      ],
