          "title": "Questions 21-24: Notice",
          "text": "CAMPUS SHUTTLE NOTICE\nDue to roadwork, the shuttle stop in front of Science Hall will be unavailable from August 24 through August 28. During this period, passengers should use the temporary stop at East Library. Shuttles will run every 20 minutes from 7:00 A.M. to 7:00 P.M. Normal service will resume on August 31. Passengers who need mobility assistance should call the transportation office at least one day in advance.",
          "zh": "校园班车通知\n由于道路施工，Science Hall（理学楼）门前的班车站将从 8 月 24 日至 8 月 28 日停用。在此期间，乘客请使用东图书馆的临时站点。班车早 7:00 至晚 7:00 每 20 分钟一班。正常服务将于 8 月 31 日恢复。需要行动协助的乘客请至少提前一天致电交通办公室。"
        },
        {
          "title": "Questions 21-24: Message",
          "text": "To: Professor Kim\nMy train is scheduled to arrive at Central Station at 8:30 A.M. on Wednesday, August 26. I had planned to take the campus shuttle directly to Science Hall, but I saw the route notice. Since I will be carrying two equipment cases, could a laboratory member meet me at the East Library stop at about 9:00? I have an orientation meeting at 9:30 and would like to store the cases beforehand. - Leo Martin",
          "zh": "收件人：Kim 教授\n我的火车定于 8 月 26 日（周三）上午 8:30 到达中央车站。我原本打算直接坐校园班车到 Science Hall，但看到了线路变更通知。由于我会带着两个设备箱，能否请一位实验室成员 9:00 左右在东图书馆站接我？我 9:30 有一个入职说明会，想先把箱子存放好。 —— Leo Martin"
        }
